      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work each ear as a short cone in grey. Switch to pink for the inner 2 rounds to create the ear cup."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: 6 sc in magic ring (6 sts)"
          }
