              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "safety-eyes"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "safety eyes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " between rounds 8 and 9, 2 cm apart. Stuff the head and body. Sew the head to the top of the body. Flatten the ears and sew them to the crown at round 3, angling outward. Thread the tail chain through the body base from inside before closing the opening."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
