        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Embroider the nose in pink: 3 straight stitches meeting at a point. Thread a 15 cm length of white thread through the muzzle, knot at the centre, then trim to 3 cm each side for whiskers. Weave in all ends. Use "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
